{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EXO","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"出埃及記","commonName":"出埃及記","title":"出埃及記","order":2,"numberOfChapters":40,"sha256":"975f8d6f5a961502e0544f5845356bd86e40024b75e074eaca3a53bffa657137","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/1.json","lastChapterNumber":40,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/40.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1212},"chapter":{"number":31,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["會幕的技工"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華曉諭摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「看哪，猶大支派中，戶珥的孫子、烏利的兒子比撒列，我已經提他的名召他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["我也以我的靈充滿了他，使他有智慧，有聰明，有知識，能做各樣的工，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["能想出巧工，用金、銀、銅製造各物，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["又能刻寶石，可以鑲嵌，能雕刻木頭，能做各樣的工。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我分派但支派中、亞希撒抹的兒子亞何利亞伯與他同工。凡心裏有智慧的，我更使他們有智慧，能做我一切所吩咐的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["就是會幕和法櫃，並其上的施恩座，與會幕中一切的器具，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["桌子和桌子的器具，精金的燈臺和燈臺的一切器具並香壇，"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["燔祭壇和壇的一切器具，並洗濯盆與盆座，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["精工做的禮服，和祭司亞倫並他兒子用以供祭司職分的聖衣，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["膏油和為聖所用馨香的香料。他們都要照我一切所吩咐的去做。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["安息日"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和華曉諭摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["「你要吩咐以色列人說：『你們務要守我的安息日；因為這是你我之間世世代代的證據，使你們知道我－耶和華是叫你們成為聖的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["所以你們要守安息日，以為聖日。凡干犯這日的，必要把他治死；凡在這日做工的，必從民中剪除。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["六日要做工，但第七日是安息聖日，是向耶和華守為聖的。凡在安息日做工的，必要把他治死。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["故此，以色列人要世世代代守安息日為永遠的約。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["這是我和以色列人永遠的證據；因為六日之內耶和華造天地，第七日便安息舒暢。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["耶和華在西奈山和摩西說完了話，就把兩塊法版交給他，是上帝用指頭寫的石版。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/31.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/32.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EXO/30.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}